Statement of Purpose

The Context Receipts proposal and specification materials in this repository are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal, to the extent possible under law.

The purpose of this dedication is to make the proposal, schema, examples, and related specification text maximally reusable by developers, researchers, standards groups, companies, open-source projects, and public-interest organizations.

Code packages or reference implementations in this repository may include their own package-level license declarations. Where a package declares a different license, that package-level license applies to that package.

